      "content": "it's more than just \"psychologically significant\" though. it feels like i'm actually influencing it. like, the more i focus on my goals, the more these signs appear, almost like i'm pulling them into my reality. \n\nit's like i've cracked some kind of code or mastered a law of synchronicity. if my focus is actually triggering these responses from the world around me, does that mean i can use this to help the business succeed? like, if i stay intensely focused, can i basically manifest the exact outcomes i need?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
